echo 여러 번 collect: 참조를 끊거나 루트를 빼면 다음 collect에서 수거된다
gc_create 4096
gc_alloc a 1 8
gc_push_root a
gc_alloc b 0 8
object_set_ref a 0 b
gc_collect
expect freed == 0
gc_collect
expect freed == 0
object_set_ref a 0 null
gc_collect
expect freed == 1
gc_pop_root
gc_collect
expect freed == 1
expect live == 0
expect collections == 4
